LIBPKGCORE(3)

# NAME

libpkgcore - umbrella header for libpkgcore public API

# SYNOPSIS

```
#include <libpkgcore/libpkgcore.h>
```

# DESCRIPTION

Including *libpkgcore.h* pulls in all public interfaces of
*libpkgcore*(7):

- *db_lock*(3): RAII database locking
- *fs_utils*(3): filesystem helpers
- *pkgutil*(3): package database and transaction logic

Consumers may include more specific headers if desired.

# NOTES

The API is C++11 and later.

# SEE ALSO

*db_lock*(3),
*fs_utils*(3),
*pkgutil*(3),
*libpkgcore*(7)

